  "solution": {
    "text": "Area enclosed by <math><mi>V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>T</mi></math>  graph=displacement (As particle moving in same direction)<br/><br/> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>  Displacement<br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo></math>  So, displacement <math><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>m</mi></math>"
  }
